    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Accenture plc is a for-profit public company headquartered in Dublin, traded under the ticker ACN, with SEC CIK number 0001467373. Its website describes the company as embracing the power of change to create 360-degree value and shared success for clients, people, shareholders, partners, and communities, and as working across industries and around the world to create better experiences using emerging technologies and human ingenuity.\n\nThe site discusses what it calls the Human + AI era, in which leaders can redesign work, accelerate skills, and reinvent HR so people and AI work together to create measurable growth, stronger experiences, and lasting enterprise value. It states that after two years of rapid AI acceleration, global executives enter 2026 with confidence, but data shows gaps standing in the way of scale and value. The site also says AI is pushing power demand beyond grid limits, and that winning data center developers are shifting to a power-first strategy by securing capacity early, aligning with utilities, and designing for flexibility. It describes cyber resilience as a strategic mandate in today's AI-driven threat landscape, and notes that Accenture is helping the European Commission's Directorate-General for International Partnerships to scale AI across global operations.",
